{'symbol': 'LYB', 'date': '2023-05-08 12:08:00', 'title': 'LYONDELLBASELL INTRODUCES GREEN FINANCING FRAMEWORK TO HELP FURTHER SUSTAINABILITY GOALS', 'text': 'HOUSTON , MAY 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LYONDELLBASELL (NYSE: LYB) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS PUBLISHED ITS INAUGURAL GREEN FINANCING FRAMEWORK TO HELP ADVANCE ITS LONG-TERM SUSTAINABILITY GOALS. "OUR GREEN FINANCING FRAMEWORK REFLECTS THE DECISIVE STEPS WE ARE TAKING TO ALLOCATE CAPITAL TOWARD INITIATIVES ALIGNED WITH OUR SUSTAINABILITY STRATEGY," SAID PETER VANACKER, LYONDELLBASELL CEO.'}